Package: hugepages-reserve-service
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: Service for reserving hugepages on NUMA nodes
 A systemd service for reserving hugepages on NUMA nodes based on configuration.
 Supports 2MB and 1GB hugepages with per-node configuration.
 .
 This package provides a configuration-driven way to reserve hugepages
 at system startup, useful for applications requiring large memory pages.
